{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST 'EM UP\u00a0</strong>WITH YOUR PHONE-GUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect Gloobi is a strategic, space-themed FPS with a weird and offbeat vibe, where you split your focus between shredding your foes to pieces and replenishing your ammo by playing the game on your phone, during your challenging battles across the galaxy! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel across the galaxy\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle and shred many kinds of aliens to pieces in a different world each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/f526c63dff3bbdb17f44c82c6a003b05.poster.avif?t=1764884094\" width=797 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/f526c63dff3bbdb17f44c82c6a003b05.webm?t=1764884094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Be the\u00a0tech king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate your foes with <strong>many kinds of exotic phones</strong> and download different apps that <strong><u>change the way you play</u></strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/1683eec534dbd01e75d8c0cd7156b224.poster.avif?t=1764884094\" width=798 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/1683eec534dbd01e75d8c0cd7156b224.webm?t=1764884094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to protect Gloobi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game on your phone in mid-battle <strong>to gain ammo</strong> while trying to survive.<br><span class